### Question Four

(4) **Who is the most popular non-fiction adult author in each of the top five libraries by checkouts?**

This question requires multiple filters and, most importantly, the removal of null values in the *Author* column.

::: {#77cbddd9 .cell execution_count=12}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(library_checkouts
 .filter(pl.col('Item').eq('Non Fiction'),
         pl.col('Age').eq('ADULT'),
         pl.col('Author').is_not_null())
 .with_columns(pl.col('Author').str.strip_chars(','))
 .group_by('Author','Library').len()
 .sort('len', descending=True) # <1>
 .group_by('Library').first()
 .top_k(5, by='len')
 .select(pl.exclude('len'))
 .with_columns(pl.col('Author').str.split(', ').list.reverse().list.join(' ')) # <2>
 )
```

