### Question Seven

(7) **Use your local time zone and show the day and time when one of my favorite books, *This Side of Paradise*, was checked out.** 

When most people hear the name F. Scott Fitzgerald, they immediately think of *The Great Gatsby*. However, I would argue that his lesser-known novel, *This Side of Paradise*, is his best work. If you have not read it yet, give it a try. I will be waiting for your thank you email.

::: {#1e0c6aee .cell execution_count=15}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(library_checkouts
 .filter(pl.col('Title').str.contains(r'(?i)this side of paradise')) # <1>
 .with_columns(pl.col('Title').str.strip_chars('/ '))
 .with_columns(pl.col('Date').dt.convert_time_zone('America/Chicago')) # <2>
 .with_columns(Day=pl.col('Date').dt.strftime('%A'), # <3>
               Time=pl.col('Date').dt.time())
 .select('Title','Date','Day','Time')
 )
```

